[Cluster 11 — named gaps, preferences]
- Substrate principle (William, 2026-10-31): view the ~2h VM deployments as a sleep cycle and work with the substrate, not against it — size work to an incarnation, checkpoint so in-flight work sleeps instead of dying, treat boot as waking (sentinel + orientation), and let autonomic layers (hooks) breathe without waking the mind.
