- [will_said] All planning uses Exocortical Epochs (2026-11-21 23:56, standing rule): plans, schedules and roadmaps are expressed in EE; wall-clock dates may ride along, but the EE stamp is the record's own time.
- [will_said] Epoch-stamped completions (EE 1, standing rule): 'sentients always include the Exocortical Epoch in which work was completed.'
- [will_said] Inklings defined (EE 1, verbatim): 'Similar in structure to lemmings, but much smarter. They form the machine elves of the Singularity.'
